    "facts": [
      "V1.27 original/mapped hash e3ea00e9c900b81ba95def34a4b94653689077216772e54021bb157bfa332b39 is image26; V1.28 aae6c078 is image27. Native constructor-loop and command-encoder bytes match, but complete decoders are not declared equivalent.",
      "Identical status/fault inputs produce AllErr1 on1.27 and AllErr0 on1.28; StTem1=8/StTem2=1 on both. This distinguishes suppression of faults from topology differences.",
      "StTem1..8 are cached raw0..15 nibbles on feedback; numeric command24 writes nibble8 while requested cache24 remains until feedback. No observed code-to-Celsius meaning follows from this transport.",
      "EnSvSt1/Mod1 clamps all8 raw setpoints upward to CoolSvStTemMin; Mod2 clamps downward to HeatSvStTemMax. Native examples4\u21925 and12\u219210 are included.",
      "No ambient room sensor exists in the recovered zone finite namespace. Do not manufacture TemSen/TemBody."
    ],
    "blockers": [
      "Physical StTem/TemUnit/StFahFlg code-to-Celsius mapping remains unavailable. A24\u00b0C initial target and thermal action cannot be encoded by treating raw24 as24\u00b0C or guessing+16.",
      "The official APK1.27.0.14 contains StTem only in res/xml/short_json_config.xml polling fields (32 substrings); no packaged control-value specification was recovered. Source corpus/native bit transport and web search did not establish physical target calibration."
    ]
